    "A": "Original game-ready environmental landmark cutout, warm lively finely crafted pixel-art seafaring management game. Strict 2:1 isometric orthographic, upper-left sunlight, front faces down-left and down-right. Single distinctive landmark with small coherent footing, full silhouette uncut, no ocean, no island, no backdrop. Chunky clean pixel clusters and 4-tone material ramps; readable at 150x150 pixels. No people, text, labels, watermark or interface. Transparent background, generous transparent margin, bottom-center contact. Match charming cream stone/honey wood/brass style but with region-specific materials. ",
    "B": "ORIGINAL game-ready environmental landmark cutout for a warm lively finely crafted PIXEL ART seafaring management game. Strict 2:1 isometric orthographic, upper-left light, front faces down-left/down-right. Chunky clean pixel clusters, limited 4-tone ramps, designed to be readable at only150x150 native game pixels. One complete small building monument with small coherent footing, centered, entire object visible, transparent background and margins. NO landscape, backdrop, ocean, people, text, labels, watermark, UI. Honey wood, ivory stone and aged brass where appropriate, coordinated charming nautical aesthetic. Subject: ",
    "C": "ORIGINAL game-ready environmental landmark cutout, warm lively finely crafted PIXEL ART seafaring management game. Strict2:1 isometric orthographic, upper-left lighting. Chunky clean pixel clusters, limited4tone ramps, large readable silhouette designed to be reduced to150x150 game pixels. One full monument on a small coherent footing, centered and uncut with transparent margins. No island, ocean, background, people, text, labels, watermark or interface. Coordinated ivory stone, honey wood and aged brass nautical craft with regional material differences. Subject: "
